<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Nouvelle demande de contact</title>
</head>
<body style="background-color:#f6ecdd">

    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;">
        <img 
            src="http://127.0.0.1:8000/images/logo/gbs_logo.png" 
            alt="logo glow beauty skin" 
            style="width:90px; border-radius:50%;">
        <span style="color:#698866; font-size:40px; font-weight:bold;">
            Glow Beauty Skin
        </span>
    </div>

    <main style="width:80%; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; font-size:20px; line-height:1.5; font-weight: 700">
    </main>

    <div style="width:80%; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 10px solid #ebd4bd; background-color:transparent; border-radius:10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
        
        <p>Une nouvelle demande de contact a été reçue.</p>
        
        <div style="background-color: #f6ecdd; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0; border-left: 4px solid #698869;">
            <h3 style="color: #698869; margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 18px;">Informations du contact</h3>
            
            <p style="margin: 8px 0;"><strong style="color: #698869;">Nom :</strong> {{ data.name }}</p>
            <p style="margin: 8px 0;"><strong style="color: #698869;">Email :</strong> {{ data.email }}</p>
        </div>
        
        <div style="background-color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border: 2px solid #ebd4bd; margin: 15px 0;">
            <h3 style="color: #698869; margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 18px;">Message</h3>
            <div style="background-color: #f6ecdd; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #698869; line-height: 1.6;">
                {{ data.message|nl2br }}
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #698869; font-style: italic; margin-top: 20px;">
            Reçu le {{ "now"|date("d/m/Y à H:i") }}
        </p>
        
    </div>

</body>
</html>